<Grid
  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
<Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
	<!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Text="1985-8-18" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		IMMEDIATE
		<LineBreak/>
		O 21 2300Z FEB 88
	</TextBlock>
    <!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Text="05:00Z (06:00L)" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->

    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="FM"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="RED BANNER PACIFIC FLEET"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="TO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="CO {TaskForceName}"/>
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="INFO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		10th OPERATIONAL SQN<LineBreak/>14th LANDING SHIP BDE<LineBreak/>55th NAVAL INFANTRY DIV
	</TextBlock>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="SUBJ"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="OPERATION ORDER"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="9" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" TextWrapping="Wrap">
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		1. (S) {TaskForceName} is to clear beachhead and escort the 14th Landing Ship Brigade to the landing zone. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		2. (S) Possible enemy missile boats in area, screen the Tsugaru Strait for inshore attack craft. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		3. (S) Enemy submerged assets not expected in area. Enemy air oppostion expected light following neutralisation of Misawa Airbase. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		4. (S) Enemy land forces entrenched throughout area. Prioritize enemy artillery and air defense assets. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>5. (S) Friendly air from Fokino enroute to support landing. Surviving aircraft will be attached to your task force. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		6. (S) {TaskForceName} is to transit East to RV with Petropavlovsk replenishment force post-mission. Good Luck, Comrade.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SIGNED: Khvatov
		<LineBreak/>
		KTOF
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		DECL OADR BT
	  </TextBlock>
</Grid>